{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50148","headline":"九日至江州问王使君（斯五五五） · 蔡孚","name":"九日至江州问王使君（斯五五五）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九日寻（浔）阳县，门门有菊花。\n□□今送酒，（蒋云：「阙文二当爲『白衣』。\n」）若个是陶家？\n（〖1〗按王使君疑指王勃，所以《全唐诗》卷五六把这一首编入王勃名下，恐怕不对。\n《全唐诗》的文字不尽相同，录出以便参阅。\n〖项云：「唐代『使君』乃是对刺史的尊称。\n王勃幷未担任过这类官职。\n整『王使君』当另有其人。\n盖王姓江州刺史也。\n」「或是王勃道出江州时。\n写给王姓刺史的。\n」〗）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蔡孚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50148.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50148","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}